      "writtenOn": "2023-05-30T15:42:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the partition-ness shouldn\u0027t be a platform constraint, but a build setting. So given some target X, if it has //:partition\u003dsystem, then Bazel will force an error if X depends on a vendor specific product var setting. \n\nI\u0027m not sure how to implement that from where we are, but creating two products doesn\u0027t seem like the right place to slice and dice this.",
